{"candidateAnswer":"Working on and restoring cars","evidence":"[D13:3 | 5:22 pm on 11 August, 2023] Dave: Thanks, Calvin! This is a dream come true for me, as I've always wanted to learn auto engineering and work on building a custom car.\n[D5:5 | 1:16 pm on 3 May, 2023] Dave: Thanks Calvin! Appreciate the support. I'm gonna keep learning more about auto engineering, maybe even build a custom car from scratch someday - that's the dream! For now, just gonna keep working on this project and assisting customers.\n[D4:5 | 6:24 pm on 1 May, 2023] Dave: Thanks! Appreciate the support. My dream was to open a shop and it's a step towards my other dream of working on classic cars. I love their design and engineering.\n[D3:12 | 4:15 pm on 20 April, 2023] Dave: Last weekend I went to a car show. Classic cars are so charming and the dedication people put into restoring them is amazing. That's why I'm so into auto engineering. Can't wait to show you some when you come to Boston! Oh, almost forgot to send a photo, look at this beautiful car!","itemId":"urn:uuid:1001a51f-00c2-555d-a9fb-a1dc1d982068","provenance":{"sourceCommitment":"sha256:61b3d445edc9db3e5320b77128de3336bae021244ab2c07c1aa9ef9cc8acd4cd","timestamp":"2026-04-02T14:22:55Z"},"question":"What is Dave's main passion?","referenceAnswer":"auto engineering","sources":[{"digest":{"sha256":"61b3d445edc9db3e5320b77128de3336bae021244ab2c07c1aa9ef9cc8acd4cd"}}]}